Distributors to claim from"},"returns":{"amounts":"The amounts of rewards claimed for each vlFeeDistributor"}},"claimWithPermanentEpochSkip(address[],uint256)":{"details":"Power-user entrypoint. Epochs before startEpoch are permanently forfeited.      Use this when a third party has dust-staked on behalf of the caller at an early epoch,      forcing claim iteration to start far before any real rewards.","params":{"startEpoch":"The epoch timestamp to start claiming from (0 = use default)","vlFeeDistributors":"The addresses of the vlFeeDistributors to claim from"},"returns":{"amounts":"The amounts of rewards claimed for each vlFeeDistributor"}},"depositRewards(address[],uint256[])":{"details":"The router must own the tokens to deposit when this function is called.      For doing so, the caller must have signed a permit2 authorization and used it by      calling the function `transferFromPermit2` of the RouterModuleERC20Manager module      in the **SAME TRANSACTION**. The composition ability of the router allows for this.","params":{"amounts":"The amounts of rewards to deposit","vlFeeDistributors":"The addresses of the vlFeeDistributors to deposit into"}},"stake(uint256)":{"details":"The router must own the tokens to stake when this function is called.      For doing so, the caller must have signed a permit2 authorization and used it by      calling the function `transferFromPermit2` of the RouterModuleERC20Manager module      in the **SAME TRANSACTION**. The composition ability of the router allows for this.","params":{"amount":"The amount of SDT to stake"}}},"title":"RouterModuleVLSDT","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"checkpoints(address[])":{"notice":"Checkpoint the distribution of rewards for different vlFeeDistributors"},"claim(address[])":{"notice":"Claim rewards from the vlFeeDistributors for the caller"},"claimFor(address[])":{"notice":"Claim rewards from the vlFeeDistributor for the caller to the router for composition"},"claimForWithPermanent